<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0655_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Sabrina</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0655_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Huh? I can’t hear you.\nThe connection trash.\rI already knew it would be.\nCall back from somewhere else!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0655_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wassup...\nAnythin’ new goin’ on with you?\fDon’t answer. I already know.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0655_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">There’s stronger Block Bosses than me,\nyou know.\fThat’s no good!\fI saw it in a dream. I’m still mad.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0655_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I think I got some free time on Sundays\naround noon.\rCould you call me back then?\nYou will. I know you will.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0655_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ah, wonderful!\nI got some free time right now.\rYou wanna scrap again?\nYou gon’ say yes. {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0655_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I knew it. That’s just like you.\rSo, I’ll see you at the Saffron Dojo!\fYou’ll be four minutes late. It’s fine.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0655_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I see...\nYou got the right to say no.\fI shouldn’t have got my hopes up.\fI knew you’d say no. It still hurt.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0655_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You deadass got free time to scrap me?\rIf you got plans with other people,\nyou should do that first.\fYou know who I mean. I know too.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0655_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’ll be waitin’ at the Saffron Dojo.\nDon’t forget!\fYou won’t. I checked.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0655_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Yeah, this Sabrina.\nI knew you’d call.\fI picked up before it rang.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0655_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">So, I’m pretty sure we made plans to\nmeet at the Fighting Dojo in Saffron...\fYou REALLY forgot?\fI didn’t see that comin’. Impressive.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0655_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lemme tell you about a Psychic’s\ntrainin’.\rPsychic ability is the power to\ninfluence people.\rClose your eyes, clear your mind...\nthen look hard at your sleepin’ self.\rThat’s it.\rReal Psychics don’t move stuff with\ntheir minds.\fI tried. I moved a spoon once.\fOne inch. Took all day.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0655_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You... You gon’ get even stronger than\nyou now. I know it...\rYou gon’ beat every Hustler you face\nand reach the glowin’ glory...\rI just wanted to tell you that.\fAlso, bring an umbrella Thursday.\fTalk to you later!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0655_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You a great Hustler, with a good\nbalance of brains, power, and heart.\rBut above all, your heart is what’s\nspecial.\rYou ever think about studyin’ to be\na Psychic?\fBet you’d be better than me...\fI already know you won’t. But still.</language>
	</row>
</body>
